  "_readme": "Suggested timer for each workout card. The key is the card's file name in lowercase with dashes (Hell_s_Bells.jpg -> hell-s-bells). JSON has no comments, so the examples below live under keys that start with an underscore, which the app ignores: copy one, rename the key to your card, and change the numbers. New cards get a 'for time' line added automatically; edit it if the card needs a different timer. A card can offer more than one timer: use a list of options (see _example-two-options-for-one-card); the first option is the main one, and an optional label names the others.",

